# Ad-hoc run output is ignored: every run is a fresh sample of a stochastic
# pipeline, so tracking each one adds churn without adding information.
eval-*

# Baselines ARE tracked, including their renders. They are the reference
# measurements this harness reproduces, and the four-view renders are the manual
# spot-check the benchmark relies on for "right size, wrong shape" cases that no
# automatic metric catches (see ../../README.md).
!.gitignore
!baseline-*
